  {
   "speaker": "header",
   "text": "Page 604 File Number",
   "kind": "header"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "While he was raising the hood, did you take that license plates off?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "(shakes head \"no\") No.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Who did?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "He did.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "OK.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "What did he do with the license plates after that?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "I don't know.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "But you were with him, what did you guys do with 'em?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "He took 'em off...",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "And where did he put 'em?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "He had 'em in his house but I don't know after where he put 'em.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "You saw him put 'em in the house? (Brendan nods \"yes\") And you also saw him do what? Put the key",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Yeah",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Where'd",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "In his dresser",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "He put the key?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "In his dresser.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "In his dresser. Where was the knife that he used, 'er you used. Where'd that knife go?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "He left it in the jeep.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
